  "description": "New textures made by Arky Fursblack backported on older versions",
  "body": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">This resource pack adds textures made by me. They was added officially in <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journey-into-the-light-mod\">Journey Into The Light</a> mod on Minecraft 1.21.10+ but not 1.20.1 so this resource pack will change that!</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Subscribe on creator's platforms:</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/TpP4vAMDgb\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord Server</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@unknownraccooneternaltales4940\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://t.me/eternal_tales_news\" rel=\"nofollow\">Telegram channel</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://eternaltales.wiki.gg/wiki/Eternal_Tales_Wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://vk.com/eternal_tales\" rel=\"nofollow\">VK (Russian)&nbsp;</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Euca</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1429/70/2025-12-18_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"648\" /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1429/71/2025-12-18_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"648\" /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1429/72/2025-12-18_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"648\" /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1429/73/2025-12-18_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"648\" /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1429/74/2025-12-18_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"648\" /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1429/75/2025-12-18_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"648\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>All the Euca blocks<br /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1429/80/2025-12-18_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"648\" /><br /></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Ore material sets:<br />Lunium<br /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1429/77/2025-12-18_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"648\" /></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Shadium<br /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1429/78/2025-12-18_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"648\" /></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><br />Sapphire<br /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1429/79/2025-12-18_03.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"648\" /></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><br />All the changed items at this moment<br /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1429/81/2025-12-18_03.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"656\" /><br />How they look in Recipe Book<br /><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1429/82/2025-12-18_03.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"648\" /><br /></strong></span></p>",
